    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d315">

                <pb facs="0415" n="401" sameAs="frus:frus1948v06/pg401"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">856e.00/10–1048: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the Netherlands</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Baruch</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d315-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">The Hague</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-10-10T22:00:00+01:00">October 10,
                            1948—10 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>687. Aneta story may be official and effort to beat gun and I considered it so
                    important have reiterated to Foreign Office in full our <pb facs="0416" n="402"
                        xml:id="pg402"/> Government’s position this matter and made strong protest
                    this premature publication even this sketchy outline their objection to and
                    knowledge of Cochran plan. I told them I believe this removes any lingering
                    objection they might have had to full acceptance of Cochran’s suggestions for
                    reopening discussions. It is my belief, though have no positive assurance, that
                    they will not [<hi rendition="#italic">now?</hi>] instruct both Schuurman and
                    Van Kleffens in effect that Cochran, having received their revision of his plan
                    and knowing their objections, may use his entire judgment as to form of
                    procedure, having in mind always the substance of their counterproposals.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Baruch</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d315-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d315-f1-content">
